byedpi (https://github.com/hufrea/byedpi)
-----------------------------------------
The `internal/dpiengine` package implements a minimal SOCKS5 relay and
TCP desynchronization (split, TTL delay, disorder) inspired by the MIT-licensed
byedpi / ciadpi family of tools. This repository’s implementation is original
Go code; behavioral alignment references upstream documentation and sources.

